WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:09.108
This video shows how to create a fee record for one student on your phone. Use it when a single student needs a fee record of their own.

00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:19.635
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Collect Payments. This page lists the fee records of the month.

00:00:20.607 --> 00:00:27.999
Tap Generate Single Fee Record at the top of the page. A window opens titled Create Fee Record.

00:00:28.457 --> 00:00:36.785
Choose the class, here Class 1 - A. Then tap the student box, search for the student, and tap their name in the list.

00:00:38.783 --> 00:00:47.927
Choose the fee category, here Tuition Fee. The base amount fills in by itself, and a note says it comes from the class fee structure.

00:00:53.565 --> 00:01:06.333
If the student has already paid, enter the amount paid and choose the receiving account. Here nothing is paid, so tap Create. The window closes and the new record appears in the list.

00:01:17.735 --> 00:01:23.951
The fee record is created. You can now collect the payment whenever the student pays.
